{"seq":3,"slug":"low-altitude-logistics-innovation","title":"低空物流与创新模式","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/modern-logistics/logistics-digitalization-innovation/low-altitude-logistics-innovation","wordCount":1691,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"低空物流与创新模式\">低空物流与创新模式</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>低空经济是2024-2026年中国产业政策最重要的新赛道之一，物流配送是其中商业化落地最快的应用场景。从无人机支线运输到社区无人配送车，低空物流正在重新定义&quot;最后一公里&quot;的成本结构与服务边界，使偏远地区、紧急医疗、高频即时配送等长期受制于传统运力的场景获得全新的解决方案。</p>\n<h3 id=\"无人机物流技术路线\">无人机物流技术路线</h3><p>物流无人机按载重和航程分为多个等级，覆盖从末端配送到支线运输的不同场景：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[&quot;物流无人机分级&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;末端配送级&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;支线运输级&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;干线货运级&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;载重: 1-10kg / 航程: 5-20km&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;场景: 外卖/快递/医疗急救&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;载重: 10-100kg / 航程: 50-200km&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;场景: 城际快递/农产品/岛屿供给&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;载重: 500kg-吨级 / 航程: 500km+&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;场景: 货运航线(仍在研发阶段)&quot;]\">graph TB\n    A[\"物流无人机分级\"] --&gt; B[\"末端配送级\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"支线运输级\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"干线货运级\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"载重: 1-10kg / 航程: 5-20km\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"场景: 外卖/快递/医疗急救\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"载重: 10-100kg / 航程: 50-200km\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"场景: 城际快递/农产品/岛屿供给\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"载重: 500kg-吨级 / 航程: 500km+\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"场景: 货运航线(仍在研发阶段)\"]</pre><p><strong>主要技术指标</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>末端配送型</th>\n<th>支线运输型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最大载重</td>\n<td>5-10kg</td>\n<td>30-100kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>巡航速度</td>\n<td>40-80km/h</td>\n<td>100-200km/h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>续航时间</td>\n<td>20-40min</td>\n<td>1-3h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动力系统</td>\n<td>多旋翼电动</td>\n<td>复合翼/倾转旋翼</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抗风等级</td>\n<td>5级</td>\n<td>6-7级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精度着陆</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span></span></span></span></span>30cm</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span></span></span></span></span>1m</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>代表企业</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>美团无人机：城市低空配送，已在深圳、上海开通常态化航线</li>\n<li>丰翼科技（顺丰）：支线物流，大湾区运输医疗样本/电子产品</li>\n<li>亿航智能：eVTOL载人+载货两用平台</li>\n<li>峰飞航空：大载重eVTOL，对标支线货运航线</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"无人机航线规划与空域管理\">无人机航线规划与空域管理</h3><p>无人机物流的规模化运营，核心瓶颈不在飞行器本身，而在空域管理和航线规划体系：</p>\n<p><strong>空域分类管理（中国低空空域改革）</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>空域类型</th>\n<th>高度</th>\n<th>管理模式</th>\n<th>物流适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>管制空域</td>\n<td>全高度</td>\n<td>需审批</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监视空域</td>\n<td>120m-300m</td>\n<td>报备制</td>\n<td>支线运输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报告空域</td>\n<td>120m以下</td>\n<td>备案制</td>\n<td>末端配送</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>航线规划约束</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\sum_{i=1}^{n} d_i \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\forall i: h_i \\leq H_{max}, \\quad E_{consumed} \\leq E_{battery} \\times 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 段航路距离，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为飞行高度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为空域限高，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{battery}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为电池总能量（保留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span> 安全余量）。</p>\n<p><strong>U-TM（无人机交通管理）系统</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>类似地面交通管理，为低空无人机提供冲突检测与分离服务</li>\n<li>中国UTMISS系统（民航局）：全国统一低空飞行服务平台</li>\n<li>核心功能：飞行计划申报、实时监控、电子围栏、紧急避让</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"社区配送无人车\">社区配送无人车</h3><p>无人配送车（Autonomous Delivery Vehicle, ADV）是解决末端配送&quot;最后100米&quot;的另一种无人化方案：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;站点装货&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;自主驾驶至楼栋&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;到达通知用户&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;用户取货&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;返回站点&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; A\">graph LR\n    A[\"站点装货\"] --&gt; B[\"自主驾驶至楼栋\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"到达通知用户\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"用户取货\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"返回站点\"]\n    E --&gt; A</pre><p><strong>技术参数对比</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>L4无人配送车</th>\n<th>传统快递三轮车</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>载重</td>\n<td>100-300kg</td>\n<td>200-500kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时速</td>\n<td>5-15km/h</td>\n<td>15-25km/h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日配送量</td>\n<td>60-100单</td>\n<td>150-300单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人力成本</td>\n<td>远程监控1人管5-10台</td>\n<td>1人1车</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>24小时运营</td>\n<td>可以</td>\n<td>受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恶劣天气</td>\n<td>部分场景受限</td>\n<td>人工适应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>代表企业与场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>美团魔袋20：校园/园区外卖配送，已在清华、北大等高校常态运营</li>\n<li>京东小哥：社区快递配送，已进入超过200个社区</li>\n<li>新石器：零售+配送复合功能车</li>\n<li>毫末智行：末端物流场景L4自动驾驶方案</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>经济性分析</strong>：</p>\n<p>单车日运营成本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mn>365</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{daily} = \\frac{C_{vehicle}}{365 \\times Y_{life}} + C_{energy} + C_{maintenance} + C_{remote}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">365</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"to